MODEL: the AUTHORS' released checkpoint (calibration run)
  authors' checkpoint: 18.03 M params, history_size 3, actions -> repeat into 10, pixels imagenet
  driving spec: ../../authors_driving_spec.json (first-2 and last-2 padding were indistinguishable; stated as a deviation)
  every other protocol element is unchanged from our own run

domain guard (precondition):
  paired ||z_real - z_env|| median over 10 frames: 0.012 (threshold 1.0) -> pass

episodes: 50 sampled (seed 42); start = episode frame 0; goal = 100 frames later in the same episode

fitting position probe on 400 rendered positions
  probe fit R^2 0.9971 (in-sample), mean abs error 1.50 arena units
